# Prettier is configured with endOfLine: "lf". Without this, Git's autocrlf on
# Windows rewrites checkouts to CRLF and `npm run format:check` fails locally
# while passing in CI. Normalize to LF in the repo and in every working copy.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary and generated files Git must not touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webm binary
*.ico binary
package-lock.json -diff
